#: bobby_bobbypin/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "BOBBY PIN"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Before you see them you can <i>feel</i> them—an overwhelming air of cool, of rebellion and edge given form. Leather and metal and the best hair and eyebrows you've ever seen... this rogue is impossibly cool, and looking at you like you owe them money."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You got a problem, punk!?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What? No."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't even know who you are... how could I?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, but it sounds like you do."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh. Well... good!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "'Cause trust me, you don't want none of this!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh. Damn, that was rude of me, wasn't it..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "What, me?! Nahhh I'm just messin' with ya."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "The name's Bobby. Bobby Pinn."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And you might not have heard of me yet, but trust me, the name Bobby Pinn's gonna be known all over the house real soon."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "How's this strike you? 'The Pinn Crime Syndicate.'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Wait, wait. No. 'The Pinn Criminal Empire.'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You some kind of crime boss?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They sound equally silly."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about 'The Pinn Gang'?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Not yet... but I will be, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That's hater talk! The Pinn Criminal Empire doesn't have time or room for haters!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hmm... it's kinda old-timey, but it does have that kinda Talc Capone feel to it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-5/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Talc Capone?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-5/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You know, that famous powdery gangster from Chicago, Talcum Powder 'Talc' Capone?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-5/21/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever you say..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-5/21/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Anyway, that guy. It's reminiscent, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-0/c-5/21/c-0/18/c-0/18
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But I'm gonna blow even him right outta the water."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I've been locked up in Hoove's bag for years, and I'm finally free, free, free!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-1/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hoove?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-1/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can't believe Hoove did that..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You know, the vacuum cleaner!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-1/c-6/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Right."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean, it wasn't his fault, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I had a lotta time to think while I was in there, you know, about who I was gonna be when I got out."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Getting bent all outta shape... it does something to a pin, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Makes you reevaluate your priorities in life. Makes ya think long and hard about who you truly are."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is you bent out of shape?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't normally look like this?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You got bent up?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh yeah! I used to be pin-straight, if you can believe it!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Getting sucked up into Hoove's bag was a real revelation."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I never really felt quite like myself before. Woulda liked it better if I didn't have to be locked away for a while first, but..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I feel like for the first time in my life who I am and who I've always been are one and the same, baby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really can't buy that kind of self-reflection."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good for you, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Thanks! I mean, I know it, but it's real affirming to hear it from somebody else too."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You really can't! I'm more powerful than ever now."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It HAS been good for me, yeah. Thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I've been locked up but I'm here now, baby! I'm ready to take what's mine!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "The real question at this point is just where to begin."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Where do I situate my burgeoning criminal enterprise..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "After all, you know the first rule of business: location location location!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's supposed to be for real estate."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds about right."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about the second rule of business?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/c-14/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Some truths are universal, baby! Location is always gonna impact your ability to make money!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/c-15/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Of course it does, because I know what the hell I'm talkin' about!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/c-16/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "A-B-M-M."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/c-16/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Always Be Making Money."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/c-16/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hmm... can't really argue that one."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-4/c-16/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Of course you can't—'cause I'm right, as always!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hmmm... tell you what."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Let's make a game outta this. I gotta scout some locations for Pinn HQ."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "If you can find me, I'll let you be a small part of this little venture."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/24
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Whattaya say?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll play along, but I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/c-17/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Boooo! Don't be a coward!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/c-17/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm gonna sign you up anyway—you can work on accepting it later."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/c-18/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Rad. Welcome to the Pinn Family, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/c-19/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I don't think you get what you're saying no to here."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-5/c-19/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So I'm just gonna go ahead and put you down for a 'hell yes'."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Just to make sure you don't miss this opportunity of a lifetime, I'm gonna give you a hint about where I'll be."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm gonna be doin' my dirty deeds in a place that gets you real clean."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_intro/0/g-6/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Catch me if you can, normie! I'm out!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "BOO!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Don't even flinch.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Scream loudly.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, you startled me!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Bobby stare at each other in a silence so intense and overwhelming Bobby doesn't even seem certain if you heard them."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Uhhh... BOO!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I heard you the first time."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh. Okay, uh. I see. A fellow stone-cold gangster... I got you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hahahaha, listen to that scream! You can't be a hardened criminal if you leave yourself wide open like that!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Did I? Damn couldn't you have maybe screamed a little or something?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That's like saying \"oh that's hilarious\" when someone tells a joke."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Like, bitch! If it was that hilarious then laugh! A little heehee hoho won't kill you!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/c-2/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But look at me going on when we've got BUSINESS to discuss."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Welcome, recruit, to the future location of the heart of the Pinn Crime Syndicate!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby gestures expansively to the laundry room."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Just look at all the opportunities here!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just see detergent and dirty clothes..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What opportunities exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me more, boss."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That's cause your criminal third eye is closed, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You gotta crack that sucker open and see what's right in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "There's opportunities all over this place! But I'm glad you're asking questions."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh yeah, I like the sound of that. 'Boss!'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So check it out. I call this one Sud Scam."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You go out around the house, spilling stuff all over the place."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You know, 'by accident'. Wink wink wonk."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They wink at you four times in a row, huge and exaggerated, just to be sure you're both on the same page."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "When they're like, 'oh man, what do I do!? My clothes are ruined!'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You tell 'em you got just the person for them, and you send 'em to me."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/48
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You wash their clothes, and while that's going on I go through their pockets."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/56
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Next thing you know we're rolling in the dough!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/64/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if they don't have anything in their pockets?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/65/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if we get caught?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's the dumbest thing I've ever heard."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hm... yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I guess we aren't all mega-rich gangsters like myself walking around with fat stacks in our pockets."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-6/32
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So maybe there is just one tiny flaw..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh that's easy, we just don't!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But I guess as a rookie you could mess it up for both of us... and then where would we be?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-7/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Maybe this one ain't it after all..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "What kind of attitude is that!?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You can't just be negative without anything helpful to say!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-8/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That's what we in the crime business call Premium Hating!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-1/c-8/37
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You gotta come with more than that if you wanna make it in the Pinn Gang!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Alright alright. Let's see how this one strikes you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I call this one the ol' Switcheroo."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "People bring us their laundry. We take that laundry and sell it online."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Then we replace it with cheaper pieces that 'fell off the back of the truck'."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "When they say, 'hey, that's not my clothes!' we're like, yeah it is!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I look at you and I'm like, 'that's what you brought me, right?'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/48
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And you go 'yeah boss, that was it.'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/56
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And we just stare at the customer until they leave."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/64
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Eh? Eh? How about it?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/72/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't think you could have a worse idea, but..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/73/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm just not sure we're going to get much money for any of the clothes in this house..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/74/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The thing is that scam only works once, and we need to be able to repeat it..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "WOOOOW! You are an EXPERT level hater."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You could be a little more positive, you know! Criminal empires don't run on negativity!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-9/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But if I can't count on you to run your end of the scam it's a bust."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Huh... I guess we ain't exactly living in some vintage fashion house..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Guess that is kind of a flaw..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Dammit, recruit. When you're right, you're right."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "A scam's gotta be self-sustaining, otherwise there ain't no point!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Okay. So maybe THAT one wouldn't work, but there's gotta be something good here with stealing clothes."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "After all, that's where people keep their valuables!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A red-haired laundry hamper explodes into your midst, all rage and indignation. She points at Bobby with a trembling hand."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/30
msgctxt "Harper"
msgid "STEALING CLOTHES?!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/44
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "AAAAAGHH! WHAT THE HELL!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/55
msgctxt "Harper"
msgid "I WON'T LET YOU TAKE ANYONE ELSE! NEVER AGAIN, YOU HEAR ME!? NEVER AGAIN!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/63
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Calm down you harebrained harpy, I'm just spitballin' ideas here!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/71
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She points at you now."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/79
msgctxt "Harper"
msgid "TAKE YOUR KIDNAPPER FRIEND AND GET OUTTA HERE BEFORE I TOSS YOU OUT MYSELF!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/87
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm goin' I'm goin', yeesh!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/95
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby twists out of her reach, making their way to the door with you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/109
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Damn, damn, damn. Bobby Pinn can read a room, and I'm reading that the laundry room ain't the place for Pinn, Inc."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/120
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Alright then, newbie. Here's your hint for the next place you can find me..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/128
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm a pin of BUSINESS. A LEGITIMATE businesspin."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_firstencounter/0/g-3/136
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You got that? Pinn, out!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/10
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "For the last time, I don't have games on my computer."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I can literally see a game right there on the desktop!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/29
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Well, that's for me. Not you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/37
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "I work hard, I deserve a little self-care."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/45
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Mama needs to play a little Arachnid Old Maid every now and then to soothe her nerves."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/53
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hey! I got nerves that need soothing too!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/61
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "From what? Pretending to run a criminal empire?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/69
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm not PRETENDING, this is LEGITIMATE!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/77
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Sure, kid, sure. Oh look, your friend is here."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/85
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Leave us alone, we got BUSINESS to talk."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/93
msgctxt "Willi"
msgid "Sure... business."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/107
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well well well, look who made it!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/115
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Welcome to the potential future home of the Pinn Family's Crime Paradise!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/126/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The office? Really?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/127/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My office?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/128/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really getting criminal enterprise vibes from this place, if I'm being honest."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Open your mind, baby! Criminal enterprises are way more than a guy in a trenchcoat selling you stuff in an alley."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Any real mafioso's got an accountant and an office, and uh... whatnot!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Can't you just see it now? Right there on, the desk, on a big shiny plate:"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/30
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Robert 'Bobby' Pinn - Legitimate Businesspin."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like the legitimate part is going to have people asking questions..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Robert' is too stuffy."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're not taking over my desk."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "What? But the point of that is so they DON'T have to ask questions."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Am I a businesspin? Yes."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Is that business legitimate? Also yes."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-3/37
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It's real simple baby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "God, I thought the 'Bobby' in quotes would make it obvious I am NOT stuffy old Robert Pinn."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm 'BOBBY', sensual and sexy criminal mastermind, with a brain as fat as my wallet!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-4/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is having a fat brain a good thing?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-4/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean, yeah! Bigger is always better!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-4/29/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Why not? Come on, you're not even using it!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You won't even notice me at it—I just need the name plate anyway."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-5/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I said no."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-0/c-5/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "BOOOOO! HATER!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But alright, if the name plate ain't sellin' ya on the vision, check this out."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I call it 'Funny Money, Honey.'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So we tell people I'm a finance pin."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "My scam HQ, the office, really sells people on the whole thing."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'll make a buncha fake degrees and licenses and all that."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/43
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "They bring me the money, I take it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/51
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Then we tell 'em that I invested it and it's totally making a bunch of money and they just gotta be patient."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/59
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Meanwhile we get some more suckers, take their money, and give it to the old suckers."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/67
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "We just keep finding new suckers to keep the scam going. It can't fail!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/75/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's called a ponzi scheme, and they don't usually end well."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/76/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only problem is we'll run out of suckers, and then it all comes crashing down."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/77/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is actually even dumber than your other ideas."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "What? You're telling me someone else has done this extremely brilliant and original scam already?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That's impossible! There's no way!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-6/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look it up sometime... you'll see."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-6/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "No, no. A busy and successful gangster like myself doesn't have time for research."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-6/29/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That's nerd shit, and time's money!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-6/29/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Ahh yeah... I mean, a hardened gangster like me can handle a couple years in jail, but I can't be endangering the rest of my crime family."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Besides, if I get locked up again, who's gonna take care of the rest of you yahoos?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-7/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "No, no, that won't do."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You say dumber, but I think you mean to say, 'brillianter'."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-8/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If I meant that I would have said it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Look, it's okay to admit your grasp on vocabulary ain't quite as strong as mine."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "As a gangster and legitimate businesspin I gotta have a way with words."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It's a part of my... uh... job, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-1/c-8/21/c-0/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But whatever, if you ain't helping this scheme falls apart before we even start."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Mmm... it seems like the office just ain't gonna be the place for us."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But hey, that's okay, baby! A gangster like me is flexible."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So here's your hint for our next potential location: DARKNESS! SCARY!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-2/24/b/1
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Potentially completely locked!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "S-spiders..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_office/0/g-2/38
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "PINN OUT, BABY!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The attic is dark and cold—that's to be expected. What you don't expect, however, is that Bobby has company before you get here."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Then again, it might be more accurate to say that Bobby's company has them."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/22
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "Listen here, you little worm."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/33
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "You think you can just slither into my attic and start helping yourself to my real estate?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/41
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "N-no, I-"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/49
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "No <i>Mistress</i>."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/60
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "N-no, Mistress..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/68
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "'N-no?' You spineless, pathetic little pin."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/76
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "Nothing happens in this attic without MY say so, you understand?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/84
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "You will not be playing pretend gangster in here without my express permission you sniveling, lowly little maggot."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/92
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The safe casts her steely gaze towards you, and you could swear the room has gotten ten degrees colder."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/100/b/1
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "Ah, Playmate."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/103
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "Another uninvited guest—why don't you go explain to them that you will NOT be conducting your business here."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/111
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Yes ma'am..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/119
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "Good pin. Don't disturb me again, or I'll have to punish the both of you... and it won't be the fun sort of punishment."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/127/b/1
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "Fun for us, perhaps."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/133/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Monique wanders into the fray, looking uncharacteristically confused."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/134/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "In the middle distance, a confused sound comes from a new, moneyed object."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/137
msgctxt "Monique"
msgid "What now?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/148
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "Nobody you need to worry about, my angel of accounting. No one of worth or consequence."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/156
msgctxt "Monique"
msgid "Oh, I see."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/181
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby lowers their voice, doing their best to appear entirely unbothered by the conversation you just witnessed. They try to strike a casual pose, leaning one arm against the wall, but they accidentally hit a spiderweb and shriek."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/189
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "GODDAMN!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/203
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They look back towards Sophia and lower their voice again."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/217
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Welcome to the attic."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/225
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Potential future site of the Pinn Criminal Empire."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/233/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you really think there's room for us here?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/234/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Didn't you just get told you can't be here?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/235/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This place seems like not quite cool enough for you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean there's room for a gangster anywhere they can fit in, baby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Bobby Pinn makes a way where there ain't no way."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But it does kinda feel like there really... ain't no way around here."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "What, by that stuffy old safe? I ain't scared of her."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are your teeth chattering?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It's just cold up here, okay!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-1/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I am NOT SCARED!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I was just thinking the same thing."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean it's COLD, yeah, and- and it's dark and scary, which is like, great for striking fear in the hearts of enemies."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But Bobby Pinn runs a warm and welcoming criminal empire—I dunno if this place is really great for the vibes I was hoping to cultivate."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But just to be sure, let's see how this scam strikes ya."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I call this one 'Scared Broke'."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So check it out: you bring our potential suckers up here to the attic."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "They think they're gonna have a meeting with me, the big boss."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/35
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "We keep 'em waiting a while, a good twenty minutes or something, and you keep reassuring 'em I'm coming."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I sneak up on 'em and scare the shit out of 'em."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "They drop all their money and valuables, as one does when scared shitless."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "We pick it all up and get rich. Repeat repeat repeat!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What if they don't actually have any money or valuables?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think there's already too many people up here to maintain the kind of scary environment you'll need."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How many times are you going to try a variation on this same bad idea?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Damn, I never thought about that..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Guess that's not gonna work, is it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "God, yeah, you're right. It was a great idea, but..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "All these wise guys up here crowding my shit and ruining the vibes!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-4/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Yes, it's not my fault, but it won't work, will it..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "This is TOTALLY different than the last ideas I had!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You just ain't got no VISION, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-5/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And if you ain't got no vision you ain't gonna see it for this plan, and then you can't execute!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-0/c-5/37
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So I guess that one's out."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby looks around the room, as though desperately trying to source some inspiration from somewhere."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They fold their arms over their body, trying to keep warm while still trying to look effortlessly cool. The result is less than convincing."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well, look. Maybe this time you come up with a scheme for us, huh recruit?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to, but not here."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We should just rob the safe."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "YOU'RE the big crime genius, not me."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "This place is cramping your style, right? I knew it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "No, this place just doesn't have what it takes to host the Pinn Gang."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I wanted to give it a fair chance, but my time is too valuable to waste, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Wow, I love the way you think. Huge brain moves here."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "At the very mention of breaking into the safe, Sophia barges in."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/49
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her very presence blazes through the little Pinn."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/57
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "EEEEK!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/71
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She needs not even open her mouth - it's clear from her demeanor that she is saying 'GET OUT OF MY ATTIC BEFORE I HAVE YOU FLAYED, YOU WRETCHED, UNWORTHY CRETINS!'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/79 bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-2/36
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "YIKES! I'M OUTTA HERE!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/93 bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-2/47
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby calls over their shoulder as they disappear down the stairs."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/98 bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-2/55 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/41
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "YOU CAN FIND ME WHERE THE MAGIC HAPPENS, BABY!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-7/106 bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-2/63 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/49
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "A DEN OF SIN AND REST IN EQUAL MEASURE!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean I am, but damn! Sometimes I want a break, you know!?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "What's the point of having underlings when they never wanna do any of the work for you!?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-8/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Sometimes a criminal mastermind needs a little break!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-8/37
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But whatever. Can't get blood from a stone and all that."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-1/c-8/45
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So fine. The attic ain't doin' it for us. I see that now."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby strides forward boldly, head held high."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "This place ain't for the Pinn Gang! It sucks!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_attic/0/g-2/25
msgctxt "Sophia"
msgid "WHAT DID YOU SAY, YOU MISERABLE LITTLE WORM!?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "From behind the two of you, the specter of a ghostly woman materializes, placing a cold, transparent hand on Bobby's shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/14
msgctxt "Zoey"
msgid "HELLO, NEW FRIEND!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/22
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "AGGHHHH!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/33
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby takes off running, without a second look back. They call over their shoulder after you as they flee."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/60
msgctxt "Zoey"
msgid "Aww... I just wanted to say hi..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry Zoey..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/69/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's because everyone hates you, Zoey."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Zoey"
msgid "Come back soon, okay!?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_zoey/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Zoey"
msgid "See you later..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As soon as you chance upon Bobby's newest location, you find Betty already speaking with them."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/14
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Bobby? Is that you?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/22
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You... you know me?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/30
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Little Bobby Pinn, look at you now! You've changed so much!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/38
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well yeah... I'm not a little pin anymore, you know."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/46
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "No, you certainly aren't. You've really come into your own, haven't you?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/54
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Why do you have to say it like that? I'm a grown pin!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/62
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And beyond that, I'm a goddamn GANGSTER!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/70
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Oh you certainly are, look at you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/78
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She pinches Bobby's cheek, which really seems to upset them."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/89
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "HEY! STOP THAT!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/100
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Your family has been worried sick about you, you know? You should stop into the bathroom and see them before you go."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/108
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I will, I just... wait, you know my family?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/116
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "Of course I do. They come through here all the time, you know, talking about their sweet Bobby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/124
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I knew you when you were just a little thing, one pin among many. Even then you were special."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/132
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/140
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Gangsters don't have feelings. But if I did, I'd be real touched."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/148
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby's gaze falls upon you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/156
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Alright, that's enough reminiscing. I got business to run."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/164
msgctxt "Betty"
msgid "I'll just bet you do... take care, sweetheart."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/172
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. You too."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/190
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby sits at the edge of the bed, looking unusually thoughtful. They pat the spot next to them, inviting you to take a seat."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/198
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "There you are, rookie. Have a seat."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/206/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You okay?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/207/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't need an invite to sit on my own bed."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/208/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How's the crime business, boss?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Yeah, I'm alright... just weird being back here so close to where I grew up."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh get over yourself and just sit down! I'm tryin' to be vulnerable here, damn!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It's... fine, it's fine."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I thought maybe we could talk about something else, actually."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Being here so close to where I grew up... it's kinda messin' with me."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You know I haven't been back to see my family since I got sucked up by Hoove?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I... I will. I just haven't gotten up the courage yet."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would it help if I came with you?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't be a baby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I don't know, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That's real nice of you to offer, but I gotta do it on my own."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It's just..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Don't be a dick!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "This is real life shit, okay!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It's not about like, who I am, you know what I mean..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "My family's always been real accepting. I think they knew I was meant for more than being another one of the crowd in there."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But that's the problem too. They're... so accepting."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "If I come home and I haven't made shit of myself... they're all gonna pat me on the back and ruffle my hair."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "They're gonna say 'oh, our sweet baby Bobby! Our angel! You're perfect just the way you are!'"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And that's a bad thing?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't see the problem."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Yeah, it is!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "The PROBLEM is..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So?! So the problem is..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It feels like failing. I spent all this time away from my family."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "If I come home and I haven't made anything of myself..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I dunno. As sweet as they are it just kinda hurts worse, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "It'd be easier if they were nightmares. If they just yelled at me and let me be angry."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Knowing they'd be happy no matter what I do... I dunno."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/43
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Am I making any sense here?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get it, honestly."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/53/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You shouldn't put so much pressure on yourself, Bobby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I guess I shouldn't have expected an underling to understand a boss."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-9/24
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "No point in wasting anymore time, is there?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-9/32
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I got one more location I think will work for HQ."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-9/40 bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You can find all kind of extreme temperatures there."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-9/48 bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-4/35
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hot, cold... and all kinds of work happens there."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-9/56
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "See you there, recruit."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You do?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-10/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure I do. Sometimes it's harder when people are nice to you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Exactly, exactly."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You know, when people are mean... you can harden yourself. Be the villain they make you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But when they're soft and sweet... damn, man. Just feels like your mind kinda fills in the gaps between their words."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well if I don't, who will?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-2/c-11/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "How else am I gonna make something of myself? Nobody else is gonna do it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I want my family to be PROUD of me, not just cool with me."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "So I gotta be a little hard on myself."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Otherwise I won't have no kinda pressure on myself at all."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And then I'll just do... nothing."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think it has to be like that."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you should just try to find what makes you happy."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's always another way."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I hope you're right, friend, but I don't really believe it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "...I thought I knew already, but maybe I never had a damn clue."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Maybe... I hope you're right."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby stands, dusting their hands off—from what, you're not sure, but they seem to think it makes them look cool."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Alright rookie, that's enough wastin' time talkin' about feelings."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "We got one more place to check out, and I think it's a real winner."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_bedroom/0/g-4/43
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "See you there."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For once, Bobby isn't in the middle of a conversation or cheerily posturing when you find them. They look lost in thought."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You made it. Welcome to the future site of the Pinn Crime Family HQ."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Chin up, boss."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You finally realize how useless all this has been?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You could tell, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Guess there's no point in keeping it in any longer."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm alright. I..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh, hell. I guess there's no point in pretending."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Guess so, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I've been all over this damn house. I had so many ideas for schemes..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But what's the point? This is a house, not some bustling metropolis full of suckers."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "We all have the same shit! We all share the same space!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You can't share space with your suckers! That shit is awkward as hell!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You know I spent all my time locked up thinking about all the ways I was gonna make money..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "All the ways I was gonna make my family see I wasn't just little Bobby Pinn anymore. I was gonna be somebody."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But now that I'm here... I don't even know what the hell I'm supposed to do with myself."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I bet you can't unlock that door right now."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah right."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would you give me a demonstration? I wanna see an expert at work."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby follows your gaze to the door where you keep your iron."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You're on!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Yeah!? I'll show you right here, right now!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/c-4/21 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby strides over to the door where you keep your iron."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/c-4/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You're gonna feel real stupid in just a minute!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well hell, why not? It doesn't take much..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Watch the master at work, rookie!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby sets to work at the lock, closing their eyes and holding one hand before their back."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Wait, actually, I can do ya one better."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They contort themselves into all sorts of knots, closing their eyes and twisting themselves into the keyhole without the use of their hands at all."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's a sight so bizarre you wonder if perhaps you ought to have taken off the dateviators—a bobby pin fitting into a keyhole would have been far less disturbing to witness."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/49
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "What's all this then?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/57
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "What're you, the fuzz?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/65
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'm the door."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/73
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well, buzz off and open already! I'm trying to show off my world-class lock-picking skills to my associate here!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/81
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Sigh."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/89
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I s'pose you're harmless. If you want to see the wizard, go right ahead."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/103
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "How'd you like that shit, huh!? I told you!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/120
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Wooooow! Now that's what I call showmanship!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/134
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "AAAA! HOW MANY TIMES AM I GONNA GET STARTLED IN THIS DAMN HOUSE?!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/145
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "My apologies, friend! I meant no harm!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/153
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "I only wanted to commend you for the commensurate showmanship you showed there."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/161
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "I mean, those twists and feats of dexterity! Audiences LOVE a thrill like that!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/169
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "...they do?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/177
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Of COURSE they do! Trust me, I would know. Audiences LOVE me!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/185
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "I was in there the entire time, you know, wondering to myself—can they overcome my lock?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/193
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "An iron like me can't be locked behind just any sort of lock, y'know!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/201
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/209
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Yeah! And even though I have NO problem retaining an audience's attention myself... none whatsoever... why, just imagine the sort of heights we could reach with you as a part of my act!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/217
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Wait, really? You mean... I could be part of your magic show?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/225
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Most certainly! Just imagine it... you and I, pulling off daring escapes! Me, the world-famous magician! You, my bright-eyed young assistant, pulling in the younger crowd!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/233
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I... I could be famous... I could really be somebody."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/241
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hell yeah I'll be part of your act!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/252
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Splendid!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/260
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I just gotta wind up some business first, if you don't mind givin' me a minute..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/268
msgctxt "I, Ronaldini"
msgid "Naturally... I'll be here when you're ready."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/285
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I... I can't believe what just happened! I wasn't expecting all this!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/296/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going to happen to the Pinn Gang?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/297/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about us?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "The Pinn Gang?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_kitchen/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Us?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/3
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well... look. Maybe it's better we don't work together."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "After all, it'd make the huge crush I have on you kinda awkward."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/22
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Power dynamics and all that, you know? The Pinn Crime Family has standards! Ethics!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/30
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'd have to submit all this paperwork to HR... what a pain in the ass!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait... crush?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You're telling me you couldn't tell!?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You never felt that crazy electricity between the two of us!? I was tryin' to stay cool..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But I was gonna blow at some point. Better we don't have all that baggage in our way now."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so glad it's not just me."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not interested."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just wanted to be friends..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Of course it's not just you! This shit was MUTUAL, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Anyone could see it!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Can you imagine our suckers trying to let us scam them, meanwhile we're makin' eyes at each other the whole time?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Disgusting!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, you're right... it's probably for the best we just wind down the business."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It sounds kinda hot honestly."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Yeah. I don't want anything gettin' in our way."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "From here on out, it's me and you, baby! Partners in love, not crime."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like the sound of that..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-0/26/c-0/7 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby offers you their arm, and as you walk forward together you're struck by just how good it feels to be partners, ready to support Bobby in their exciting new venture and receive their support in turn."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-0/26/c-0/15 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you watch Bobby perform you're deeply proud to call them your beloved—when they turn to smile at you in the crowd they make you feel as if you're the only one in the room."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh? You like bein' watched?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Interesting... I'll have to remember that."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But in the meantime..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I guess I got some rehearsing to do for my new gig."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/39
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You wanna come with? I can get you a backstage pass..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love that."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's just go out when you're done."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hell yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'll be thinkin' of you the whole time! Wait for me... I'll take you somewhere special when I'm done."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I look forward to it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-1/39/c-1/47/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Sure enough, when you and Bobby finally come together you're treated to a truly magical night. Bobby pours all of the same energy they'd put into making something of themselves into making you feel special, and without the pretense of work between the two of you, you truly find yourself on equal footing."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/10
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh... okay."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well. This is awkward."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean, I guess we could still be friends..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want that either."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends is good."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean look, if you want me to be your enemy I can do that too..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But I don't advise it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Just because I ain't a hardened criminal at this point in time doesn't mean I don't still know how to be a hardass... but if that's how it's gonna be then that's how it's gonna be."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Beat it, bum."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well I'm glad we can still keep that up. You're a great support system!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And I'm gonna need to see a friendly face in the audience."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-1/23 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I better see you at the show!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-1/31/0/s/0 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You definitely will."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-1/31/c-0/7 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/c-0/31/c-0/7 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hell yeah! Congratulations to you, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-1/31/c-0/18 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/18 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/c-0/31/c-0/18 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-1/31/c-0/18
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You gotta front row seat to the meteoric rise of Bobby Pinn, superstar!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-2/37/c-1/31/c-0/26/0/s/0 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/26/0/s/0 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/c-0/31/c-0/26/0/s/0 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-1/31/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really lucked out, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh. Uh... well, sure, alright."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I mean, if I got you with me one way or another I'm gonna be alright."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "After all, I'm gonna need to see a friendly face in the audience."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_ending/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hell yeah! Congratulations, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/3
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well hey, it's fine we don't work together."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I think we make better friends than boss and henchperson, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was hoping we could be more than friends..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I couldn't agree more."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We really don't need to be anything at all."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "More than friends? Me 'n you?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Uuuuhhhh... I dunno about all that."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Look. We got a good thing goin' here, don't we? Why you gotta ruin that with awkward confessions?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "All I got for ya is friendship. I got my heart in my hands here, offerin' it to ya in a strictly platonic manner."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "We can still do this!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll be happy to keep you in my life as a friend."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh thank goodness."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I was really hoping I could count on seeing you at my shows, you know?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/c-0/23 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I feel like as long as I can see that smile in the audience I can do anything."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-0/50/c-0/31/0/s/0 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can count on me, Bobby. I'll be there."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hell yeah! God, what a relief."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I was really hoping I could count on seeing you at my shows..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/10
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh yeah? It's like that, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well hey, okay. You wanna be enemies I guess that's your choice..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/26
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But I warn ya, Bobby Pinn ain't someone you wanna have against you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/34
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Watch your back, former amigo... I may not be in the crime business no more, but..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/42
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I still know how to make your life hell."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Focus on making your own life hell, loser."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/53/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever you say, deadbeat."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm good, thanks. But you... you ain't gonna be good no more."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/53/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Watch your back..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/53/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh you're dead to me now. It's truly over for you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_friends_ending/0/c-2/53/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll see."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/3
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Come on. Don't pretend you care about me or the gang."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/11
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You've been shitting on me and my ideas this entire time."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "'What's going to happen to the Pinn Gang', what a goddamn joke!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/27
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You can stop acting like you care now. It's over!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought we were cool..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn I didn't know you were such a sensitive baby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just curious, don't get all huffy."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I was tryin' to be cool with you out of NECESSITY, baby. It's a matter of survival."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And hey! I don't need you no more, so..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "See! That shit! You just say things like that all the time!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "God you SUCK SO BAD!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Nobody's huffy!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "But this is exactly the kind of shit I'm talking about! You SUCK!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Just scram already, why don'tcha!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gladly."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have a nice life, loser."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm over this."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_ending/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "YEAH GOOD! DON'T COME BACK!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_joiner/19
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You picked a fight you weren't ready for."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_hate_joiner/27
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "That's one less piece of discarded hair ornaments out of your life!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well well well."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I told you never to show your face again yet here you are."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You're either real brave or real stupid."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/24
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Personally my money's on stupid."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The only stupid thing around here is you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on Bobby, I can't take having you as my enemy. (USE SASS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I should kill you where you stand for your disrespect."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Lucky for you, I got a show to prepare for..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're all talk, Pinn."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "And you're all SUCK! Get outta my face already."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Oh yeah??"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Could you ever be an enemy to... this face?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby gazes at your incredibly and temporarily charming visage. They seem... moved."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hmm... alright, alright. Not bad, rookie."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You approached me with respect, like the former gangster that I am... I like that."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Alright. Me n' you are good. Just don't cross me again, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_hate_return/0/c-1/21/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't dream of it."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Heyyy! I've been hopin' you might come by..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I've been practicin' this real dangerous trick and my concentration's shot."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "A little smooch could help me focus, you know..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh uh, you're not putting this on me."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Kiss them.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Aww, man... well hey, can't blame a pin for tryin', huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Let's get together later, okay baby?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When your lips meet, that ultra-cool facade Bobby so carefully cultivated, fades away immediately. They melt in your embrace, still smiling dreamily when you finally part."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Wooohooo! Alright alright alright."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I thought that was gonna help but I'm more distracted than ever now..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "We're just gonna have to get together later, alright babe?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/g-0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/g-0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_love_return/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Me too... see you soon."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hey amigo! Hope life's been treatin' ya well."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, buddy."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Same to you, friend."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Things've been goin' great with the show, but honestly..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Don't laugh. But I feel like I'm the luckiest pin in the world."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Not just about the magic stuff, but havin' you as my pal."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Ain't a lot of people who can say they have someone like you in their corner!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww... right back atcha, Bobby."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hell! You're gonna make me emotional and I gotta FOCUS!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Seriously though, I better see you in the crowd! I'm only here 'cause of your amazing support!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll catch the next one."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't miss it for the world."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Aww, alright, I understand. Next one!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobbypin_friend_return/0/c-1/39/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hell yeah! See you then, pal!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Hang on, seriously?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_join/0/18/s/0 bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Damn! Don't get my hopes up for nothin', baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Come back when you got it!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "You ready to get serious?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes now."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Damn! Stop gettin' a pin's hopes up!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Well I'll be here..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Ooooo, starting with the infamous gang leader? I hope we won't be unleashing a real criminal out into the world!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "C'mon Bobby, time to make like a library book and check out!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a bobby pin, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As a pin Bobby was quite excitable, but as a human they seem surprisingly contemplative."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You expected some cheering and jumping, perhaps a 'yippee'... but Bobby only raises their hands to their face, feeling its contours with quiet wonder."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Is this really me now? I have a human body?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby's hands curl into fists, and they turn to you with a manic gleam in their eye."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/35
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Just THINK of all the scams I could pull with these babies!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good to see becoming human hasn't changed you at all."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There are so many more fun things to do with a human body, Bobby..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Of course not! I'm Bobby 'til the day I die, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Which could actually happen seeing as I'm mortal now... yikes!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Let's just forget about all that dying shit. Look out, world!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_realized/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Here comes Bobby Pinn, human being!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby's excitement settles into something calmer, a heat that simmers in the air between you and sears you to your bones."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/8
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Mmm, you're so right."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/16
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm gonna crack you open like a safe, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/24
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm gonna break and enter on that ass!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/32
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm gonna... I'm..."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/40
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "I'm gonna work on my crime-themed flirting!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/48
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Let's just get outta here, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby makes good on their promise to crack you open, putting their dextrous newly-human hands to good use indeed."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you're alone all that smooth, quick talk falls by the wayside—Bobby shows you a depth of passion and intensity which you could never have imagined when you first met."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_divert/75
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They're loath to leave you in the morning, but excited about their future nonetheless. As they kiss you goodbye, you can't help but feel a sense of hope for their new life."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby makes their way to Las Vegas immediately, bound and determined to make something of themselves as a street performer and magician."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Upon arriving, however, they very quickly realize Vegas is a town filled with Bobbies, and the prospect of struggling to stand out quickly drives them to return home."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Bobby bounces from place to place, searching for a career that suits them, but nothing is as exciting as magic or a hypothetical life of crime."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When a 1920's gangster-themed bar opens up in the city just a few months later, Bobby takes up work as a bartender there, and it's there they finally thrive."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Serving drinks and handling cash makes Bobby happier than anything they could have ever imagined—the sharp clothing and silly lingo don't hurt either."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/40
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Tonight's special drink is the bee's knees! The cat's pajamas!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/48
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "Trust me, one sip of this'll have ya zozzled, spifflicated, scrooched!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/56
msgctxt "Bobby"
msgid "That'll be 14 clams, doll and daddy-o!"
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They send you photos of themselves in costume often, updating you on their gangster persona's fictional happenings."
msgstr ""

#: bobby_bobbypin/bobby_love_join/72
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Somehow the more things change the more they stay the same—but you're just happy Bobby is happy."
msgstr ""
